# Local stow ignore for the `hypr` package.
# Presence of this file overrides .stow-global-ignore for this package only,
# allowing ~/.config/hypr/bindings.conf to be stowed while the global ignore
# continues to protect every other package from leaking hypr configs.
#
# Defensive: keep machine-specific hardware configs out even if they ever
# end up under hypr/.config/hypr/ by mistake.
monitors\.conf
input\.conf
